00:05:16.281 --> 00:05:17.907
- Yes.

00:05:17.907 --> 00:05:21.018
I think that there's a
very simple answer to this.

00:05:21.018 --> 00:05:23.665
My big belief, when
you're selling sponsorship

00:05:23.665 --> 00:05:27.241
to something new is you ask
for as much as possible.

00:05:27.241 --> 00:05:28.773
And I'm not kidding.

00:05:28.773 --> 00:05:29.957
You don't know where your ceiling is.

00:05:29.957 --> 00:05:31.885
If you go by cpm's and views

00:05:31.885 --> 00:05:34.625
you're really in a tough spot because

00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:38.084
views and impressions
have been commoditized

00:05:38.084 --> 00:05:40.522
to such a level that you'll
never hit enough scale.

00:05:40.522 --> 00:05:42.496
Most people are 
gonna make four dollars

00:05:42.496 --> 00:05:45.143
on their show sponsorship
if they go that route.

00:05:45.143 --> 00:05:47.743
It's the association,
notice I don't run ads

00:05:47.743 --> 00:05:49.369
or sell sponsorship on this show

00:05:49.369 --> 00:05:52.782
and if I did, I would
expect substantial bank.

00:05:52.782 --> 00:05:54.593
Because not only,
it's not about the

00:05:54.593 --> 00:05:56.706
20, 30, 40, 50 thousand YouTube

00:05:56.706 --> 00:05:59.701
and 50, 60, 70, 80 thousand
Facebook imperssions

00:05:59.701 --> 00:06:01.419
and awareness and 
all that nature.

00:06:01.419 --> 00:06:03.207
It's about the brand association.

00:06:03.207 --> 00:06:05.018
I'm endorsing it by accepting it

00:06:05.018 --> 00:06:06.723
'cause I've never 
done it before.

00:06:06.723 --> 00:06:08.441
And so there's an 
extra value on that.

00:06:08.441 --> 00:06:10.647
So I think, the thing that
you really need to think about

00:06:10.647 --> 00:06:14.780
is if it's a small 
business, start up,

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.103
you need to negotiate.

00:06:16.103 --> 00:06:18.634
There needs to be just a
price and you start high.

00:06:18.634 --> 00:06:19.958
If it's a media buying agency,

00:06:19.958 --> 00:06:21.931
you're already in trouble
because they're looking to buy

00:06:21.931 --> 00:06:24.996
scale and they're really looking
to commoditize your traffic

00:06:24.996 --> 00:06:27.875
and that is not gonna make
sense for 99.9% of the people

00:06:27.875 --> 00:06:30.360
listening and watching 
this show and so

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:32.705
my advice is to price it--

00:06:32.705 --> 00:06:34.261
and then the second 
part of your question

00:06:34.261 --> 00:06:35.816
about the conversion of sales.

00:06:35.816 --> 00:06:37.325
You don't wanna 
be in direct response,

00:06:37.325 --> 00:06:39.299
conversion based 
business either.

00:06:39.299 --> 00:06:42.828
What you wanna be is in the
brand association pricing, right.

00:06:42.828 --> 00:06:47.898
You can't put a price on a
small business-oriented solution

00:06:47.898 --> 00:06:51.357
being a sponsor of this
show because they're getting

00:06:51.357 --> 00:06:54.050
to entrepreneurs and
executives through this channel

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.302
and there's more depth than width.

00:06:56.302 --> 00:06:59.924
So I would price it as
high as humanly possible

00:06:59.924 --> 00:07:02.734
and let it land to where
the market actually says.

00:07:02.734 --> 00:07:05.265
I think one of the big mistakes
that a lot of my friends

00:07:05.265 --> 00:07:08.005
who watch this show and lot
of people that negotiate

00:07:08.005 --> 00:07:10.698
in general, they don't 
price accordingly

00:07:10.698 --> 00:07:12.997
because they ask 
for what they want.

00:07:12.997 --> 00:07:15.249
And usually, you should
at least double or triple

00:07:15.249 --> 00:07:17.292
what you want to leave
room for the negotiation.

00:07:17.292 --> 00:07:20.171
Or, you know, a lot of times
you're limiting your upside

00:07:20.171 --> 00:07:22.052
by not recognizing 
that you missed

00:07:22.052 --> 00:07:25.135
or underpriced your value prop.

